cel outgoing held gestures while retaining the player's selected tool. Worker allowed/blocked replies update a stationary full-square footprint; actual placement revalidates the claim. Genuine Classroom student/teacher furniture, Reception registration desk/waiting chairs, Common Room and other existing contexts are integrated. The authored north door now has all 72 genuine poses, preserving its original nine frames, source, accepted alias and gameplay geometry.\n\nCloses #2022.\n\n## Evidence obtained\n\n- Actual frozen product `63f8288f1386f6ac4194c189e1888e5b261a501d`: both strict TypeScript projects, complete **8448 passing cases / 708 files / 2 existing skips**, actual Cloudflare production build. The local complete suite uses four workers with original case budgets; earlier default-worker filesystem-scan timeouts and documentation failures are preserved honestly.\n- Asset gate: 10 actor clip atlases and 40 rendered-art entries validated.\n- Three genuine compiled FullHD BasicCell cases: real capacity bootstrap, q0/q1 public purchases and whole paused Save/Load; exact new north-door network bodies/loader decodes at backside camera135/225 and whole snapshot equality after a full camera turn. Original workers1/retries0/case60s/expect10s. Root opened both actual screenshots.\n- Earlier explicitly dated built-client records cover stationary allowed→blocked placement without mouse motion, fresh post-Load/New commands without rearming, square build/removal, Yard bench, Classroom/Reception purchases, minimap publication and native input ownership. Their actual runtime subjects and original failures remain visible; these targeted passes are not the full hosted browser gate.\n- Actual source/PNG/dispatch omissions produce RED and exact restoration GREEN; producer controls and original test-consumer failures are published.\n- Independent exact-source review: current main is ancestor; all 4976 source/frame references match published LFS OIDs; no unapproved ordinary Rotate